# A home TV box with Jellyfin, and graphs of it all in Grafana (docs/cookbooks/jellyfin-box.md).
# title: Jellyfin TV box with graphs
# needs: About 2.5 GB more memory.
# asks: Your media folder (KIA_MEDIA_DIR), unless it's media/ in the kia folder; and an API key from Jellyfin (KIA_JELLYFIN_TOKEN) for its dashboard.
# order: 6
KIA_STACK=jellyfin,observability
